comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-03T11:15:46.153Z","harness:codex","Live all-history census 2026-08-03 after tracker organization: 43,787 events; 9,577 carry a detected harness; non-null model 0, effort 702, role 37, topic 0. Fresh Codex claim and update events record harness and unique instance correctly but model, effort, role, and topic as explicit null. The coverage instrument therefore remains a real-corpus gate prerequisite for the cross-harness adapter pm-c0lrdm and semantic attribution pm-3zgh2c, not a fixture-only utility."
  "2026-08-06T17:02:05.449Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-06: all-status duplicate search for provenance coverage, instrument integrity, corpus model coverage, and live history found this issue as canonical; closed pm-0zcwz6 and pm-9gvazz are predecessor/resolver lineage, not duplicates. Active scope is SDK/CLI/health-visible bounded corpus coverage with inert-signal diagnostics and a real negative control."
  "2026-08-06T17:23:01.968Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: provenance coverage now consumes the live bounded history-event index, compares configured signal descriptors with observed/unavailable/legacy values, emits inert and undeclared negative-control warnings, and carries an explicit source/truncation receipt."
  "2026-08-06T20:12:17.433Z","harness:codex","Final verification: exact coverage passed across 441 files and 6,902 tests at 100% statements (49461/49461), branches (35933/35933), functions (10115/10115), and lines (47921/47921). TypeScript, ESLint, duplicate detection, 100% docstrings, contracts, SDK surface, package boundaries, SDK parity, token/context/tracker gates, zero-vulnerability audits, and temporary packed npx/direct-SDK/bunx acceptance passed. Timing budgets passed in a clean isolated sample; later host-load samples were invalidated by unrelated system contention without changing budgets."
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T14:28:51.005Z","harness:claude-code",An analyzer whose only caller is its own unit test is indistinguishable from an unimplemented feature at the level that matters. Grepping for a symbol outside its defining module and its spec is a two-second check that should accompany any claim that a governance capability exists.
  "2026-08-06T20:12:05.230Z","harness:codex","A provenance analyzer becomes operational only when it consumes bounded live immutable history and reports unavailable, inert, and undeclared dimensions with a continuation receipt."
